### 1. prueba sin token (tiene que rebotar con 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/conductores

### 2. crear un conductor nuevo
POST http://localhost:3000/api/conductores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Carlos",
    "apellido": "Gomez",
    "numero_documento": "34567890",
    "numero_licencia": "LIC-998877",
    "fecha_alta_licencia": "2022-05-10",
    "fecha_vencimiento_licencia": "2027-05-10"
}

### 3. listar todos los conductores
GET http://localhost:3000/api/conductores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. traer conductor por id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/conductores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. actualizar conductor
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/conductores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Carlos Alberto",
    "apellido": "Gomez",
    "numero_documento": "34567890",
    "numero_licencia": "LIC-998877",
    "fecha_alta_licencia": "2022-05-10",
    "fecha_vencimiento_licencia": "2028-05-10"
}

### 6. eliminar conductor
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/conductores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}